lines = PackedStringArray("Shh... you'll scare the fish.", "Name's Tomo. Been fishing this pond for forty years.", "Biggest fish I ever saw lives in there. Calls himself Gerald. Well, I call him Gerald.", "Captain Coral down at Sunny Shores says Gerald is a sea fish. Captain Coral is wrong.")
