lines = PackedStringArray("Tag! You're it! ...Oh, you're new. Hi! I'm Luma!", "Did you see the windmill on the hill? It never stops spinning. I tried to stop it once. Once.", "Ranger Hazel says the trees in the Whispering Woods talk at night. I wanna hear them!")
